# LiNC simulation-only panel wiring.
#
# Loaded after linc.hal (which creates cnc_panel.*) and before the display.
# The reference baiermill_sim HAL replaces the physical cabinet wiring with
# rio.sim-* inputs; these nets connect the LiNC panel service to that simulated
# hardware. Do not load this file on a real machine.

# E-stop mushroom: cnc_panel.estop is the mushroom state.
net sim-estop cnc_panel.estop => rio.sim-estop

# Momentary POWER ON / POWER OFF keys. A POWER ON also resets a latched E-stop
# before rio.sim-power-on latches the machine switch.
net sim-power-on cnc_panel.power_on => rio.sim-power-on halui.estop.reset
net sim-power-off cnc_panel.power_off => rio.sim-power-off
